{
  "description": "Vectors for maskText. Defaults: every flag on and no keyPrefix (the default oagent_ applies). Passes run in order: secrets, email, card, phone. A card starts with 1-9 and never follows a + sign; a Luhn-valid run of 13-19 digits is a card unless it starts with 0 or follows +, so phone vectors use Luhn-invalid numbers or those prefixes. Known false positives are pinned: +150000000 and a bare run starting 628 are phones. notCaught marks a known gap: the input stays unchanged.",
